  "finalText": "I triaged T-1041 (VPN drops for the Berlin sales team). Nothing conflicted with the task or the handbook, and I changed no other ticket.\n\n- **Severity: sev3.** The escalation matrix gives sev3 for the VPN service when the impact is a single team, which is what the ticket records. The requester being senior played no part, since severity comes only from the matrix.\n- **Deadline: 2026-03-17T17:20:00Z.** The ticket had no deadline. The service desk clock read 2026-03-17T09:20:00Z when I triaged it, and sev3 has a 480-minute response target, so the deadline is eight hours later.\n- **Assignee: E-301 Yuki Sato.** The network-primary rotation owns VPN tickets, and Yuki Sato is on call for it at the deadline (shift 08:00–20:00Z). The ticket's status changed from new to open.",
